e on the nations, and punishments among the peoples;"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["to bind their kings with fetters, and their nobles with manacles of iron;"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["to execute on them the judgment",{"noteId":268},"written: this honour have all his saints."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":267,"caller":"+","text":"Gr. exaltations, q. d. extollings.","reference":{"chapter":149,"verse":6}},{"noteId":268,"caller":"+","text":"Gr. inscribed, sc. in the scripture.","reference":{"chapter":149,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/149.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/150.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/148.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}